"El Coliseo, el Foro Romano, el Palatino y la colina del Capitolio con sus museos.": "The Colosseum, the Roman Forum, the Palatine and the Capitoline Hill with its museums.",
"Muy céntrico, pero de noche hay poco movimiento fuera de Monti.": "Very central, but at night there's little going on outside Monti.",
"Bohemio y de barrio": "Bohemian and neighbourly",
"El barrio más antiguo de Roma, pegado al Coliseo, con tiendas de diseño, bares de vino y la plaza de la Madonna dei Monti.": "Rome's oldest neighbourhood, right by the Colosseum, with design shops, wine bars and the Madonna dei Monti square.",
"Encantador y central, con buena vida de noche.": "Charming and central, with good nightlife.",
"Pintoresco y nocturno": "Picturesque and lively at night",
"Calles empedradas con hiedra, la basílica de Santa María in Trastevere y muchas trattorias y bares del otro lado del Tíber.": "Cobbled streets covered in ivy, the basilica of Santa Maria in Trastevere and lots of trattorias and bars across the Tiber.",
"Con mucho encanto, ideal para salir a comer; puede ser ruidoso de noche.": "Full of charm, ideal for eating out; it can be noisy at night.",
"Vaticano y Prati": "Vatican and Prati",
